/td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">9</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">22</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.1 (0.5&#x02013;2.7)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Entered dining area</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">14</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">27</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.7 (0.3&#x02013;10)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Entered public restroom<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn4-ehp0115-000267">c</xref></td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">13</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">13</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">18</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5.0 (1.3&#x02013;20)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.005</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Age &#x0003c; 18 years<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn5-ehp0115-000267">d</xref></td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">27</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.3 (1.8&#x02013;10)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.002</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn2-ehp0115-000267"><label>a</label><p>Chi-square or Fisher&#x02019;s exact <italic>p</italic>-value.</p></fn><fn id="tfn3-ehp0115-000267"><label>b</label><p>Logit RR.</p></fn><fn id="tfn4-ehp0115-000267"><label>c</label><p>Following stratification for pool area exposure, the public restroom was not significantly asso